WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.431 --> 00:00:03.681
Unit three. Preventing Illness and Disease!

2
00:00:04.618 --> 00:00:07.825
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:07.875 --> 00:00:10.861
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:10.911 --> 00:00:14.853
Today we learn about Preventing Illness and Disease. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.011 --> 00:00:19.828
Immune system. Say it with me. Immune system!

6
00:00:23.294 --> 00:00:26.977
Vaccination. Say it with me. Vaccination!

7
00:00:30.468 --> 00:00:33.968
Hygiene habit. Say it with me. Hygiene habit!

8
00:00:37.445 --> 00:00:41.395
Contagious. Say it with me. Contagious!

9
00:00:44.878 --> 00:00:48.245
Prevention. Say it with me. Prevention!

10
00:00:51.774 --> 00:00:55.841
Healthy lifestyle. Say it with me. Healthy lifestyle!

11
00:00:59.327 --> 00:01:02.594
Rest. Say it with me. Rest!

12
00:01:06.131 --> 00:01:09.797
Nutrition. Say it with me. Nutrition!

13
00:01:13.321 --> 00:01:25.445
A strong immune system, supported by vaccination and good hygiene habits, helps prevent illness. Many diseases are contagious, so prevention matters. A healthy lifestyle with enough rest and good nutrition keeps me well.

14
00:01:25.495 --> 00:01:28.343
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:29.872 --> 00:01:34.934
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:34.984 --> 00:01:36.152
Hygiene habit!

17
00:01:37.109 --> 00:01:42.184
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:42.234 --> 00:01:43.384
Rest!

19
00:01:44.177 --> 00:01:49.984
Did you know? Getting enough sleep is one of the most effective ways to strengthen your immune system.

20
00:01:50.034 --> 00:01:51.825
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:52.565 --> 00:02:00.212
Think and answer. What daily habits help prevent illness?

22
00:02:00.262 --> 00:02:01.412
Great answer!

23
00:02:02.512 --> 00:02:07.095
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:07.145 --> 00:02:09.685
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

